## References

- Basel Committee on Banking Supervision (2013). *Principles for effective risk data
  aggregation and risk reporting* (BCBS 239). https://www.bis.org/publ/bcbs239.htm.
  Background for the data-quality and reconciliation design; this project does not claim
  compliance.
- Basel Committee on Banking Supervision (2014). *The standardised approach for measuring
  counterparty credit risk exposures* (SA-CCR, BCBS 279). https://www.bis.org/publ/bcbs279.htm.
  Cited only to mark what is out of scope; SA-CCR is not implemented.
- pandas documentation, `DataFrame.merge` (`validate=` argument used to prevent
  many-to-many joins). https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.merge.html
- Matplotlib documentation, *Backends* (non-interactive Agg backend).
  https://matplotlib.org/stable/users/explain/figure/backends.html
- NumPy documentation, *Random Generator* (seeded `default_rng`).
  https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/random/generator.html
- pytest documentation, *Managing pytest's output* (JUnit XML).
  https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/output.html

This project was developed with AI assistance.
